# Only sources go into the build context: no installed packages (Windows symlinks), build output, local databases,
# test results or secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/.turbo
**/.dev-db*
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.log
.git
.github
# Every .env file, in any folder: Next.js copies the env files it loads into the standalone output, which becomes
# /app/web in the image, so an apps/dataroom/.env.local would otherwise be published with it.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
design
docker/smoke
apps/server/data
CREDENTIALS.md
credentials.md
# Backups of a Compose install run from a checkout, and the drill folders: never in the build context.
backups
.drill
